.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-SKILLS-SYNC 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-skills-sync
.Nd synchronize and verify canonical Human-AI reasoning skills
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -check
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Op Ar REPO_PATH ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
treats
.Pa ~/.config/zsh/.agents/skills/
as the single source of truth for the 17 canonical Human-AI reasoning skills
and synchronizes or checks them across all platform and project repositories
without deleting repository-specific skills.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--check"
.It Fl -check
Verify whether target repositories match the canonical skills without writing
changes.
Exits non-zero when drift is detected.
.It Fl -json
Emit a machine-readable JSON summary of checked and synchronized repositories.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage and exit.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-check 1 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
